# Runtime state written by local agent hooks and plugins (session memory, handoff
# nudges). It is per-machine scratch, never organisation configuration, and this
# repository is public: keep it out of every commit.
.remember/
.no-amnesia/
.claude/handoff-nudge-state.json
# The context-recovery hook rewrites a root CLAUDE.md with session state after every
# compaction. This repository has no project CLAUDE.md of its own, so that file is
# runtime state too.
/CLAUDE.md
